  "target_strand": "cdn_national_tradition/laurentian",
  "target_strand_note": "The laurentian strand names Creighton (with Innis) and cites the 1937 book, the Macdonald biography and Salmon; the evidence fits it. The liberal_conservative_nationalists strand (Buckner's grouping) and analysing_tradition (Berger, Miville) also hold his name, but they record readings of him, not his contribution.",
