 "target_strand_note": "class_family ('Gender, class and family': Clark; Davidoff and Hall; Taylor) is the closest strand. Her 1985 essay cites Barbara Taylor's Eve and the New Jerusalem (n. 2), a work in this strand. studer_class_reception concerns Studer and Frevert and does not fit.",
