  "target_strand": "cdn_religion_reform/secularization_comparison",
  "target_strand_note": "secularization_comparison ('Comparisons: British secularization and moral reform'; 'Valverde's moral reform is the regulatory neighbour of the social gospel') holds her. The revisionists strand (Christie, Gauvreau, Van Die) holds her critics; it is named here as the source of the objection, not as the target.",
  "roster_row": "cdn_religion_reform",
